course: dictionary
lesson: 15238
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The sentence around the word tells you which meaning is right. «Dad is shaving in the bathroom with his razor.» Here shaving means cutting hair off close to the skin, because a razor and a bathroom are clues.
explain: The same word can mean something different in another sentence. «The carpenter planed the wood, and curly shavings fell to the floor.» Now shavings are the thin curly pieces cut off the wood. Ask yourself: what is the topic of the sentence? Hair and a razor, or wood and a carpenter?
explain: Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence in place of the word. If it still makes sense, you have probably found the right meaning.
fact: Shaving means cutting hair off close to the skin with a razor.
fact: Shavings are very thin, curly pieces cut off wood or other things.
fact: «Pencil shavings» are the little curls that come out of a sharpener.
fact: «Wood shavings» are used as soft bedding for hamsters and rabbits.
fact: Shaving cream and shaving foam help a razor glide smoothly over the skin.
exercise: «Dad is shaving in the bathroom with a razor.» What does shaving mean here? | Washing the car | *Cutting hair off close to the skin | Singing loudly | Painting the walls
exercise: «The pencil shavings filled the bin.» What are shavings? | Long, thick sticks of wood | Tiny stones from the garden | *Thin, curly pieces cut off something | Pieces of a broken window
exercise: The hamster's cage was lined with «wood shavings». What are they used for? | *As soft bedding for the hamster | In a cup of tea | In a razor | On a birthday cake
test: Which word in «Dad is shaving in the bathroom» tells you the meaning is about hair? | Dad | *bathroom | shaving | is
test: What is shaving foam used for? | Cleaning windows | Filling holes in walls | *Helping a razor glide over the skin | Putting out a fire
exam: Tom says shaving cream is for sharpening pencils. What is the right answer? | Shaving cream is a kind of pencil | Shaving cream is a type of hamster food | *Shaving cream is used with a razor when shaving hair, not for pencils | Shaving cream is for cutting wood into shavings
